    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367640/extras/d78ba303cff62f932c107585bc8f0c49.poster.avif?t=1716191763\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367640/extras/d78ba303cff62f932c107585bc8f0c49.webm?t=1716191763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367640/extras/d78ba303cff62f932c107585bc8f0c49.mp4?t=1716191763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Immerse yourself in a realm teeming with monsters that torment innocent lives. Vanquish fearsome creatures, including archmonsters, and safeguard everyone in your path. Befriend a mystical shadow dog to assist you on your perilous journey.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367640/extras/51983dabdb1e624f67c119d2496f2c7f.poster.avif?t=1716191763\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367640/extras/51983dabdb1e624f67c119d2496f2c7f.webm?t=1716191763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367640/extras/51983dabdb1e624f67c119d2496f2c7f.mp4?t=1716191763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Confront unique adversaries like orcs and zombies across various locations. Each monster boasts distinct abilities and tactics to challenge your hero. Beware of their lethal attacks, such as poison, to avoid an untimely demise.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367640/extras/ef71a06050c2989cd32b780c56e6b955.poster.avif?t=1716191763\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367640/extras/ef71a06050c2989cd32b780c56e6b955.webm?t=1716191763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367640/extras/ef71a06050c2989cd32b780c56e6b955.mp4?t=1716191763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Strengthen your hero by upgrading your skills, choosing between the sword or magic. As you progress through the game, gather valuable experience points to unlock new talents and enhance your character's prowess. Train diligently and develop a versatile skillset, ensuring you're well-equipped for the epic confrontation with the fearsome archmonsters that await.<br><br>With relentless monsters at every turn, stay vigilant and survive as long as possible on the desolate battlefields.",
